# solar-server runtime settings — sourced by deploy/run.sh (also valid under
# systemd). App-level keys are read by pydantic-settings (xlsx_core.Settings,
# prefix XLSX_).
#
# FRONTEND-ONLY DEPLOYMENT: every XLSX_* key below is OPTIONAL. The static UI
# calls exactly three endpoints — GET /api/schema, POST /api/domains/compute
# {version:"v2"}, GET /api/download/domains.xlsx?version=v2 — all of which are
# pure v2-engine compute: zero file I/O, ModelInputs built from defaults
# (XLSX_INPUTS_TOML unset). An empty env file is valid.
#
# Set keys below only if you also call v1/verify endpoints directly.

# --- service listener:
# SOLAR_HOST=127.0.0.1        # 0.0.0.0 = expose uvicorn directly, no proxy
# SOLAR_PORT=14905            # internal port; the public port is the proxy's
# SOLAR_URL_PREFIX=/solar-server   # app serves under this path prefix

# --- v1 endpoints (/compute/v1, /api/domains/compute v1, domains.xlsx v1):
# --- read dag/solar.dag.yaml only — the workbook xlsx is NOT read by v1
# --- (defined names are baked into the dag).
# XLSX_DAG_PATH=/home/appuser/solar-price-servec/dag/solar.dag.yaml

# --- /verify path 1.1 (workbook recalc + compare): needs the workbook AND a
# --- recalc engine. Code default "excel-com" is Windows-only and 503s on
# --- Linux; use libreoffice (soffice on PATH). Note: libreoffice benchmarked
# --- 2/5059 mismatches vs cached values (excel-com 0/5059). Path 1.2 (v1 vs
# --- v2) needs no engine.
# XLSX_WORKBOOK_PATH=/home/appuser/solar-price-servec/data/附件4：平价上网光伏发电项目经济评价模型（第7.1版）.xlsx
# XLSX_RECALC_ENGINE=libreoffice
# XLSX_LIBREOFFICE_PATH=/usr/bin/soffice

# --- optional base ModelInputs TOML for v2 endpoints (defaults otherwise):
# XLSX_INPUTS_TOML=/home/appuser/solar-price-servec/inputs.toml
